      "text": "Aspose.Imaging FOSS for .NET is a free, open-source .NET library — an Aspose.Imaging alternative that does zero-dependency image format detection and header probing. ImageProbe identifies a file's format and reads its basic properties — dimensions, bit depth, and frame count — directly from the file header, so you know what a file is and how big it is, fast, without pulling in a full imaging stack to decode a single pixel. It has no NuGet dependencies and targets netstandard2.0 and net8.0.",
